# Roblox place files. These are 20+ MB binaries that change wholesale on every save, so a
# committed one is unrecoverable weight in the history forever. The reviewable mirror of the
# place is `src/`, extracted from the binary with `tools/rbxl_extract.py` -- commit that.
*.rbxl
*.rbxlx
*.rbxm
*.rbxmx

# Python caches from tools/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
